flowchart TD
 A[Agent-generated changes] --> B[Automated validation]
 B --> C{Critical gate passed?}
 C -->|No| D[Block and recover / escalate]
 C -->|Yes| E[Review diff, tests and risks]
 E --> F{Human decision}
 F -->|Approve| G[Eligible for PR merge]
 F -->|Request changes| H[Create revision tasks]
 F -->|Reject| I[Stop and retain audit]
 H --> A
